# Unity Architecture

- Keep gameplay logic deterministic and in network tick flow.
- Do not mix UI concerns into network controller classes.
- Prefer one responsibility per MonoBehaviour.
- Avoid duplicating SP/MP codepaths; keep a shared gameplay core.
- Use prefab-driven setup and explicit serialized references.
- Prefer feature folders under `Assets/Scripts` (see `docs/UnityCSharp-CodeOrganization.md`); split large behaviours instead of growing god classes.
